摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Give DeepSeek Harness a real office environment. Univer Office Plugin brings spreadsheets, docs, slides, canvases, relational tables, and more into one runtime — with connected data, validation, versioned changes, and isolated worktrees for multi-agent collaboration.","id":"gh:1335241492","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-univer-office","slug":"dream-num/dsh-univer-office","topics":["deepseek-harness","deepseek-harness-plugin","dsh","dsh-plugin","office","office-harness","univer"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Give DeepSeek Harness a real office environment. Univer Office Plugin brings spreadsheets, docs, sli"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"des, canvases, relational tables, and more into one runtime — with connected data, validation, versi"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"oned changes, and isolated worktrees for multi-agent collaboration."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH × Univer Office"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> Give DeepSeek Harness a real office environment.\n>\n> Univer Office Plugin brings spreadsheets, doc"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"s, slides, canvases, relational tables, and more into one runtime — with connected data, validation,"},{"id":"p3s3","text":" versioned changes, and isolated worktrees for multi-agent collaboration."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English · 简体中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"`dsh-univer-office` is the Univer office plugin for DeepSeek Harness (DSH). Tell the agent what you "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"need and it can create or edit spreadsheets, documents, presentations, multidimensional tables, and "},{"id":"p5s3","text":"canvases, or work with existing Excel, Word, and PowerPoint files. Every change is verified and stay"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"s in the conversation for you to preview, approve, or discard."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"After installation, describe the result you want in natural language. The agent handles creation, ed"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"iting, and verification while you follow the work live and review the result in the conversation. De"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"liver spreadsheets as Excel (`.xlsx`), documents as Word (`.docx`), and presentations as PowerPoint "},{"id":"p6s4","text":"(`.pptx`) files when needed."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"#### 1. Specify the topic, audience, and page requirements"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## What can it do?"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- **Analyze and build spreadsheets** — read or create Excel data, clean fields, write formulas, appl"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"y formatting and validation, create tables, charts, pivots, filters, sparklines, conditional formatt"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"ing, and images, then export the result as `.xlsx`, `.csv`, or `.tsv`.\n- **Write and lay out documen"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"ts** — create paragraphs, rich text, lists, tasks, tables, images, charts, headers, footers, paginat"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"ion, and page layouts.\n- **Create and revise presentations** — generate a deck from an outline, rede"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"sign selected pages, edit text, shapes, images, tables, charts, and transitions, then detect off-pag"},{"id":"p9s7","text":"e, overflowing, and overlapping text.\n- **Build lightweight databases** — create Base tables, fields"},{"id":"p9s8","text":", records, and views with formula fields, filters, sorting, grouping, and Sheet-backed references.\n-"},{"id":"p9s9","text":" **Draw editable canvases** — create shapes, text, connectors, images, native charts, and diagrams, "},{"id":"p9s10","text":"with connector and layout analysis.\n- **Compose several content types** — one `.univer` file can con"},{"id":"p9s11","text":"tain Sheets, Docs, Slides, Bases, and Boards. Formulas and embedded content can reference other cont"},{"id":"p9s12","text":"ent in the same file.\n- **Work with Office files** — import `.xlsx`, `.csv`, `.tsv`, `.docx`, and `."},{"id":"p9s13","text":"pptx`, then export the edited content in the matching format.\n- **Review agent changes safely** — ev"},{"id":"p9s14","text":"ery write starts in an isolated draft. Watch changes live, then approve or discard them instead of l"},{"id":"p9s15","text":"etting the agent overwrite the current version.\n- **Compare worktree changes semantically** — switch"},{"id":"p9s16","text":" a draft or submitted worktree from View to Compare to inspect Sheet, Doc, Slide, Base, or Board cha"},{"id":"p9s17","text":"nges side by side against a pinned trunk version or another active worktree."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Capabilities"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| Content | Create and edit | Verify and review | Import | Export |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| Sheet | Cells, formulas, styles, tables, charts, pivots, filters, validation, images, and more | S"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"tructured range inspection, recalculation, screenshots, PDF printing, live preview | `.xlsx` `.csv` "},{"id":"p12s3","text":"`.tsv` | `.xlsx` `.csv` `.tsv` |\n| Doc | Paragraphs, rich text, lists, tasks, tables, images, charts"},{"id":"p12s4","text":", headers, footers, pagination | Document readback, page screenshots, PDF printing, live preview | `"},{"id":"p12s5","text":".docx` | `.docx` |\n| Slide | Pages, text, shapes, images, tables, charts, SVG layouts, transitions |"},{"id":"p12s6","text":" Structure inspection, layout lint, screenshots, PDF printing, live preview | `.pptx` | `.pptx` |\n| "},{"id":"p12s7","text":"Base | Tables, fields, records, views, formulas, filters, sorting, grouping | Structured data checks"},{"id":"p12s8","text":", workbench screenshot, live preview | — | `.xlsx` `.csv` `.tsv` |\n| Board | Shapes, text, connector"},{"id":"p12s9","text":"s, images, native charts, routing | Element analysis, screenshots, PDF printing, live preview | — | "},{"id":"p12s10","text":"images, native charts, routing | Element analysis, screenshots, PDF printing, live preview | — | — |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Every content type supports isolated draft editing, side-by-side semantic comparison, review, revisi"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"on, approval, and discarding. Base and Board support structural verification; Board file export is n"},{"id":"p13s3","text":" discarding. Base and Board support structural verification; Board file export is not yet supported."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### 2. Describe what you need"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"1. Describe the result you want and provide any source files.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Requirements and current limits"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness and Node.js `>=22.19.0`.\n- The file-tree preview needs no extra plugin: it regist"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"ers a tab type on DSH's right sidebar and claims `dsh-resource://file/**` addresses ending in `.univ"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"er`. While `dsh-better-sidebar` (`^0.19.0`) is installed it takes over file addresses at the same pr"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"iority with a broader pattern, so the preview is registered as one of its file viewers instead — bot"},{"id":"p19s5","text":"h shapes are covered, and only one ever applies.\n- Older `.univer` files are automatically upgraded "},{"id":"p19s6","text":"to format v3 when opened. A backup is saved beside the original; migration and validation run on a t"},{"id":"p19s7","text":"emporary copy, which replaces the original only after success. Failed upgrades leave the original un"},{"id":"p19s8","text":"changed. Opening the same unchanged file again reuses that backup instead of writing another copy.\n-"},{"id":"p19s9","text":" Screenshots, PDF printing, Slide layout checks, and SVG text measurement need a local Chromium-fami"},{"id":"p19s10","text":"ly browser. Chrome/Chromium and Microsoft Edge are detected automatically; set the `browserExecutabl"},{"id":"p19s11","text":"ePath` option or the `UNIVER_RENDER_BROWSER` environment variable to point at a specific executable "},{"id":"p19s12","text":"(for example Edge on Windows).\n- Slide master pages, layout pages, and speaker notes are outside the"},{"id":"p19s13","text":" current editing scope.\n- Board mind maps, tables, ink, advanced editing, and file export are not ye"},{"id":"p19s14","text":"t supported.\n- While bundled task guidance is enabled, the plugin replaces DSH's built-in `office`, "},{"id":"p19s15","text":"`office-docx`, `office-xlsx`, and `office-pptx` skills so Word, Excel, and PowerPoint tasks go throu"},{"id":"p19s16","text":"gh Univer instead of python-docx, openpyxl, or python-pptx. DSH's LibreOffice Kit skills (`office-re"},{"id":"p19s17","text":"nder`, `office-recalculate`, and `office-export-pdf`) stay available. Set `skills: false` to keep DS"},{"id":"p19s18","text":"-recalculate`, and `office-export-pdf`) stay available. Set `skills: false` to keep DSH's originals."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
